This MIT-licensed package independently reimplements a narrow set of lifecycle
contracts and safety policies using LoRA Dataset Studio as a behavioral reference:

  LoRA Dataset Studio
  Commit: de697caf9d607a29c72cebdc2794eecd6b147606
  License at that commit: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0

The referenced behavior includes Vast offer normalization, host blacklisting,
reliability-aware offer choice, leak-safe provisioning, forced cleanup, restart
reconciliation, boot monitoring, destruction-gated single replacement,
resumable transfer watchdogs, and verified result recovery.

No source code was copied from LoRA Dataset Studio. ComfyUI Cloud Run contains
an independent, dependency-free implementation scoped to this custom node.
LoRA Dataset Studio remains a read-only behavioral reference and is not a
runtime, build, or publication dependency.

The Remote Worker, fixed bootstrap, deterministic artifact builder, canvas
adapter, dependency resolver, session control plane, relay, and offline fake
provider certification were authored for this repository. No private Gold
image, personal workflow, credential, live release lock, or generated worker
archive is distributed with the source tree.
